  "translation": "Na king bilong Yisrael i tokim Yehoshafat: I stap yet wanpela man bilong askim ⟨את⟩ Yahwe long em; tasol mi les long em, long wanem em i no autim tok profet bilong gutpela long mi, tasol olgeta de bilong em i tok bilong nogut — em Mikaiahu, pikinini bilong Yimla. Na Yehoshafat i tok: King, i no ken tok olsem.",
